# wart monorepo .gitignore.
#
# Post task-52/53 reorg: the previous flat .gitignore of sibling repo
# names (`wart-*/`, `compose-*/`, `skiko/`, `markdown-renderer/`, ...)
# is obsolete — those siblings are now either subtree-merged into
# apps/, runtime/, repros/ (tracked here) or registered as submodules
# under external/ (tracked at the parent level by gitlink).
#
# Each submodule has its own .gitignore inside its own working tree.
# This .gitignore is for the parent monorepo only.

# Build artifacts
**/build/
**/target/
**/.gradle/

# Rust
**/Cargo.lock.bak

# task 67: local fork of libsignal-service-rs (own git; branch wart-wasi-transport). Submodule-ize later.
external/libsignal-service-rs/
